Yep.  Spoilers!

There are lots of ways.  Drop any potion of water onto an altar and it will
become that alignment.  Ie, drop water on a lawful altar and it becomes
holy water.

Here's a neat trick.  Get a bunch of potions of water into one pile so
they're represented by only one letter in your pack inventory.  For
instance, you have: r. 9 potions of water .  Say you have another slot
that says o. 2 potions of holy water .   Just #Dip "r" into "o" and see
what happens.

Now try to figure out how to make potions of water.


